Package: ctrl-a
Version: 1.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 64
Depends: libc6
Maintainer: iinze0 <iinze0@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/iinze0/ctrl-a
Description: Ctrl+A selects all in the normal Kali terminal
 Kali's QTerminal has no Select All. This turns Ctrl+A on in that
 terminal, and in xfce4-terminal, gnome-terminal, and Konsole.
 Ctrl+A selects the whole scrollback and copies it.
 Made by iinze0.
